@description "Local fallback routing with dispatch"

# Dispatch tries configured member actions in order until one succeeds.
# The first two names are deliberately absent; const is the local final candidate.
# This exercises fallback routing only, not recovery of an external service.

@assert: result == "I am the fallback!"

{ members: "not_found, broken_service, const", payload: { value: "I am the fallback!" } }
-> dispatch
